    {
      "description": "Electric field instrument (EFI) faceplate (FP) plasma density at 16 Hz",
      "descriptionType": "SeriesInformation"
    },
    {
      "description": "The EFIx_LP_FP Product contains extended Swarm Electrical Field Instrument (EFI) plasma data derived from the faceplate (FP) current at 16 Hz. They include: - estimates of the ionospheric electron density from the faceplate current at 16 Hz resolution; - the actual 16 Hz faceplate current measurements; - geodetic coordinates of the satellite positions interpolated to the times of the current measurements.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
